  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Energy and Natural Environment Resilience in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa (ENER-KP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Focusing on renewable energy solutions for off-grid rural communities and capacity-building to attract private sector participation and investments in the energy sector in KP, The action&#xbf;s overall objective is to foster inclusive and climate-resilient socio-economic development of KP and Pakistan. The two specific objectives are:1. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Enhance provision of green, affordable and reliable energy through the development of climate-resilient infrastructures in rural communities of mountainous areas in KP 2.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;To enhance the capacity of the KP Government to improve the policy framework and leverage private sector participation (including public private partnership) &amp;nbsp;in the entire energy value chain in the province, ensuring the development of a sustainable, resilient, and reliable electricity sector, beneftiting also women and youth.</narrative>
  </description>
